.Dd October 16, 2026
.Dt LCC-WINDOW-MANAGER 1
.Os @PROJECT_VERSION@

.Sh NAME
.Nm lcc-window-manager
.Nd configure window manager behavior and theme.

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Fl v | -version

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is part of the Lumina Control Center.
It configures the window manager used in the Lumina session.
.Pp
The Simple Editor sets the number of workspaces, the window focus policy,
where new windows are placed, and the window theme, with a preview of the
selected theme.
The Advanced Editor shows the window manager configuration file as plain
text for direct editing.

.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Display help on command line options.
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Display version information.
.El

.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/bin/lcc-window-manager
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lumina-desktop/fluxbox-init
Window manager configuration used by
.Xr fluxbox 1
in the Lumina session.
.It Pa ~/.fluxbox/styles/
.It Pa /usr/local/share/fluxbox/styles/
Searched for window themes.
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lcc 1 ,
.Xr lcc-keyboard 1 ,
.Xr fluxbox 1

